<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Uganda is accelerating its withdrawal of peacekeeping troops from Somalia, targeting a 2027 exit, while Ethiopia also plans to pull its forces out as fighting intensifies at home. The United States and an East African nation have begun joint airstrikes against a $100 million-earning al-Qaeda-linked group, and the UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year. Puntland mercenaries are fighting alongside Sudanese RSF forces, and Sudan’s army reports northern Somali fighters supporting the RSF. Somali pirates seized an Iranian fishing vessel, rescuing seven Pakistani crew members. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxON1NUWFFwY2dfX002Nm40NWVSdlROclFWazV4X3hGd2hIQ1FNMndwRlNmTVRnZ2lGbjNza3hxSEhLaFFVaWxZTVRrWDFvR3hkTkdCR3V4X0s5MTlRbmJxeS0wRlBrcFI5MzljaE55cFBuQVlaS19rTXVDS19vSjFKZGFET0pyNVhBZFJWaC1QUUF0VHg5T1BxRWZ4WV_SAZwBQVVfeXFMTkV4RXZxSkhTYmdkdVV5UVl1SXlNUTNaRFFBZVdINTBCMHdJdUtJRHBlX1gxendROHhXeFJ5d3htWkdVQVpnQzRoOFZlQjIyRG10T0dGbGdfdTNyaFowdzJya2U2UVR6U0xBN05TSlFQRURWaXRXM1UwMjV3T2daVWtfWUY2a2NSaGNfdFZkVmRiWWhQWjBIcm55OWlI?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE81bGVRY3l6VXVxMm9GWmJDVmRRTHNNaU1SYlQ5QUU5VURWV0RWSmlPRGh5SWlTS1JBM1YtRGp0S0I3WUNBZEdmZVh2cXFBVHMtRkp6MjM0NUVTUTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;reflector.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBoQUZraDIzd3p0SzlmOFlRRV9sTGJIMlNNbnloemNkN3dmU2F3bXNBMHNwanhfMWNucVdkeTNZUzdSc3k4QjhqY2RZblh5X3Z3YzBrLW5laTRmQ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPVGVxM1dXUVU3SF9sT3czYV9jd3VTWU1ydXBUMFgxSEZUTzdMUWUxc